# at e2e run time. Gitignored (.auth/ never committed). Cited by CLAUDE.md
# Rule 6.5, docs/tech-stack.md, docs/context/future-work.md. Absent on CI
# (no e2e run before docs:check); present locally after pnpm playwright
# runs (cite-check writes a stderr "exists on disk" notice locally — the
# notice does NOT fail the gate, only signals the allowlist entry could
# be retired if the file were ever committed).
